<title>JAPAN: Jan Nikkei options settled at 17,854.56--brokers.</title>
<headline>Jan Nikkei options settled at 17,854.56--brokers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers said on Friday they estimated that Nikkei options contracts for January were settled at 17,854.56.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange will announce official data on the settlement of options after the market closes at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
</text>
